# Generator for PostgreSQL conninfo strings and URIs.
# Focus: produce valid, interesting inputs for libpq functions:
# - PQconnectStart (expects conninfo string)
# - PQconninfoParse (expects conninfo string)
# - PQping (expects conninfo string)
# The output is a bytes buffer that FUZZ_PARAM_STR/FUZZ_PARAM_FILENAME may read.

